EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Dear {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for completing the Succession Recommendation Form. We have received your pathway selection: {!Case.Pathway_Confirmed__c}.

To proceed with processing your request, we need the following documentation:

**Required Documents:**
• Copy of death certificate for {!Case.Deceased_Donor__c}
• Government-issued photo ID (driver's license or passport)
• Proof of successor designation (if not already on file)

**Pathway-Specific Documents:**
{!Case.Pathway_Confirmed__c} pathway may require additional documentation. We will provide a complete checklist upon receipt of the core documents listed above.

**How to Submit:**
You can upload documents securely through your case portal, or reply to this email with scanned copies as attachments.

Case Number: {!Case.CaseNumber}
Current Status: {!Case.Status}

Once we receive and review these documents, we will contact you with next steps. The typical processing time is 5-10 business days after all documentation is complete.

Please let me know if you have any questions or need assistance with document submission.

Thank you for your cooperation.

Sincerely,

{!User.Name}
{!User.Title}
{!Organization.Name}
{!User.Phone}
{!User.Email}
